  "description": "Conversion of existing attached garage into habitable space as Utility Room, removing the existing garage door and replacing with a solid rendered wall to match existing with new window to match elsewhere. Existing garage roof replaced and raised with new flat rooflight. No change to existing house footprint or existing roof ridge lines or parapets.\nReduction of existing rear elevation bay window footprint, and insertion of new heritage style glazing.\nNew enlarged opening to rear elevation kitchen for new heritage glazing. No change to existing house footprint.\nReplacement front elevation porch roof with stone portico including replacement front door. No change to existing porch internal footprint.\nReplace existing house external uPVC windows with timber casement and fanlight windows to the front elevation to replicate existing, and replace windows to the rear elevation with aluminium heritage style glazing within existing openings.",
